WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Welcome to Education by Design. I’m Brian Kennedy Jr.

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:06.480
I want you to approach education with a sense

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:09.200
of possibility and a plan you can act on.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.160
That means asking what you want to learn, what

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.720
you want to build, and which environment can help

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.400
you take the next step. In this course, you

00:00:17.440 --> 00:00:20.400
will compare two realistic routes, check the facts that

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.880
matter, and work through the time and support your

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.080
plan requires. If you are returning to college, your

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.600
experience and responsibilities belong in the plan. If you

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:32.000
are a family member, your role can support the

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.200
learner’s independence. You will leave with a decision brief,

00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:38.400
a source ledger, a workable week, and a support

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.760
agreement. You can use your own situation privately or

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.800
work through our fictional examples. Start by writing the

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.880
decision you face and the date you need to

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.680
make it. Then open the first lesson and choose

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:51.680
the criteria that matter to you.
